1
00:00:04,770 --> 00:00:06,040
(Leonard:)Whatcha doin' there?

2
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:07,980
(Leonard:)Working on a new plan
to catch the roadrunner?

3
00:00:07,980 --> 00:00:13,420
(Sheldon:)The humorous implication being
that I am Wile E. Coyote?

4
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:16,070
(Leonard:)Yes.

5
00:00:16,070 --> 00:00:18,660
(Sheldon:)And this is a schematic
for a bird-trapping device

6
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:22,610
(Sheldon:)that will ultimately backfire
and cause me physical injury?

7
00:00:22,610 --> 00:00:24,890
(Leonard:)Yes.

8
00:00:29,750 --> 00:00:31,030
(Sheldon:)What I'm doing here

9
00:00:31,040 --> 00:00:33,920
(Sheldon:)is trying to determine
when I'm going to die.

10
00:00:33,920 --> 00:00:37,460
(Leonard:)A lot of people are working
on that research.

11
00:00:37,460 --> 00:00:40,210
(Leonard:)So what is all this?

12
00:00:40,210 --> 00:00:43,100
(Sheldon:)My family history
factoring in longevity,

13
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:45,520
(Sheldon:)propensity for disease,
et cetera.

14
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:46,580
(Leonard:)Interesting.

15
00:00:46,580 --> 00:00:48,770
(Leonard:)Cause of death for
Uncle Carl was KBB.

16
00:00:48,770 --> 00:00:49,800
What's "KBB"?

17
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:53,140
"Killed by badger."

18
00:00:53,140 --> 00:00:54,880
(Leonard:)How's that?

19
00:00:54,880 --> 00:00:56,940
(Sheldon:)It was Thanksgiving.

20
00:00:56,940 --> 00:00:58,950
Uncle Carl said, "I think

21
00:00:58,950 --> 00:01:01,580
"there's a badger living
in our chimney.

